   "intro": "<p>A free online course by Perry Mehrling, taught as a sequence of themes rather than an exam syllabus. Its central idea — that money is layered, and that every layer is a promise to pay in the one below — is the backbone of this map's <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#/map/p/money\" data-page=\"money\">How Money Works</a> branch. The module titles below group the course's weekly themes; the pages are our own notes, not course material.</p>",
